	"data": "Goal: Spatial Interaction Primitives\n\nGrab, connect, disconnect, and manipulate nodes in 3D space using hand gestures.\n\nWhat This Is\nThe core interaction vocabulary for the spatial authoring environment. Every spatial action builds on these primitives.\n\nSpecific Behaviors Needed\nGrab — pinch to select a bubble, fist to hold it\nMove — drag a held bubble through 3D space\nRelease — open hand to drop the bubble in place\nConnect — grab a bubble and drag toward another to create a typed…",
